[h1]Province Window Redux[/h1]

A reworked holding view for Crusader Kings III. Built for CK3 1.21.

An A Game of Thrones version is available: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3446295472]AGOT - Province Window Redux[/url].

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Expanding building grid[/b]: the building slots fill the middle of the window, and the grid grows as the holding gains slots.
[*][b]Every district at a glance[/b]: all district slots, including trade posts, duchy capitals, great districts and entrepots, are shown in two rows that scroll sideways.
[*][b]Add a Building Slot[/b]: buy an extra building slot for a holding (750 gold).
[*][b]Add a District Slot[/b]: buy an extra district slot for a holding (1,500 gold).
[*][b]Swap Holding Type[/b]: turn a holding into a castle, temple or city (2,500 gold).
[*][b]Trade post buttons[/b]: dismantle, oust, revoke, steal, request and expel straight from the holding view.
[*][b]Winter scenes[/b]: empty counties show winter terrain art when winter sets in.
[*]Holdings can have up to 100 building slots.
[/list]

[h2]Works With[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3611795747]Secrets of Ambrosius[/url]: with the Mystery Casting map mode on, clicking a province opens the Mysteries window aimed at it.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Replaces [b]gui/window_county_view.gui[/b], so it is incompatible with other mods that edit the holding view. Load it low in your mod list.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Bug reports and suggestions are always welcome.
